## 6. Important Checks
- **Test coverage:** Ensure new code is adequately tested.
- **Backward compatibility:** Avoid breaking existing functionality unless required.
- **Configuration:** Consider if new configuration options are needed.
- **Error handling:** Implement proper error handling and validation.
- **Performance:** Consider performance implications of your implementation.

