Add regression test for unauthenticated dashboard access
CREATE
src/components/Dashboard.test.tsx

import { render, screen } from '@testing-library/react';
import { Dashboard } from './Dashboard';
import { useAuth } from '../hooks/useAuth';

jest.mock('../hooks/useAuth');

describe('Dashboard', () => {
  it('shows loading state when user is null', () => {
    (useAuth as jest.Mock).mockReturnValue({ user: null });
    render(<Dashboard />);
    expect(screen.getByText(/loading user data/i)).toBeInTheDocument();
  });
});




```

## 7. Important Checks
- **Verify fix:** Test that the bug is resolved with the provided reproduction steps.
- **Run existing tests:** Ensure all existing tests still pass.
- **Edge cases:** Consider similar code that might have the same issue.
- **Code review:** Your fix should be clear and explainable to other developers.

